  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.2017211914062,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "regimen (i.e. 26 weeks of prescribed doses) within 8 months; also, for patients in whom treatment was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98288631439209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4235229492188,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "extended, it was necessary to complete 9 months of treatment (i.e. 39 weeks of prescribed doses)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        155.1920928955078,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "within 12 months.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4111328125,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "Eligible patients with susceptibility to fluoroquinolones can be started on the BPaLM regimen for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.421142578125,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "6 months, with dosing of individual medicines as described above. This combination of medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4464721679688,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "can be continued throughout the regimen without any prolongation (unless there is a need to make",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.5518798828125,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "up the missed doses). In cases where resistance to fluoroquinolones is identified before or after",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.435546875,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "treatment initiation, moxifloxacin can be discontinued. When the regimen is BPaL from the start or is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.4451904296875,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "changed to BPaL, it can be extended to a total of 39 weeks (counting from the start of the therapy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.4244384765625,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "with BPaLM/BPaL). This extension is justified in cases of failure to convert culture between months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.3814697265625,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "4 and 6 while on treatment; alternatively, it can be based on the clinical judgement of the treating",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4353637695312,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "physician. Up to 1 month can be added to the overall treatment duration if there is a need to make",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        170.08612060546875,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "up the missed doses.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.393798828125,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "The GDG panel acknowledged these slight differences in the treatment duration of the BPaLM and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4080810546875,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "BPaL regimens as studied in these two trials, and suggested standardizing the treatment duration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.4011840820312,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "of BPaLM to 6 months (26 weeks) during programmatic implementation; for BPaL they suggested",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.433349609375,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "the possibility of extension to a total of 9 months (39 weeks) if sputum cultures are positive between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.3401489257812,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "months 4 and 6. All medicines in the regimen are to be used throughout treatment duration, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967401504516602,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4398193359375,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "a potential extension from 26 to 39 weeks (when BPaL is used). Ideally, missing doses of all three or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.5631713867188,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "four drugs in the regimen should be avoided; however, if doses are missed, any interruption of longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985089302062988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.3397216796875,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "than 7 days should be made up by extending the treatment duration (for the number of missed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.4353637695312,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "doses); therefore, 26 or 39 weeks of prescribed doses should be completed within an overall period",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        213.14450073242188,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "of 7 or 10 months, respectively.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.64251708984375,
        380.46966552734375,
        421.3025207519531
      ],
      "text": "Missing doses and tolerances for treatment interruptions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.5104064941406,
        527.5560913085938,
        442.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "The TB-PRACTECAL and ZeNix trials used different tolerances for treatment interruption and missing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996748924255371,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.7104187011719,
        464.0546875,
        456.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "doses, and the ZeNix trial protocol provided specific rules for linezolid administration.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.4143981933594,
        527.4036254882812,
        477.857421875
      ],
      "text": "The GDG panel suggested standardizing the allowable missing doses and the approach to linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.6144104003906,
        527.6322021484375,
        491.05743408203125
      ],
      "text": "administration. The following pragmatic approach is suggested to guide clinical judgement and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        489.81439208984375,
        277.9191589355469,
        504.2574157714844
      ],
      "text": "potential minor deviations in individual cases:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.518310546875,
        78.23609924316406,
        525.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        511.518310546875,
        527.4398803710938,
        525.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "all possible efforts should be made to support the patient and manage the AEs to ensure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        524.71826171875,
        527.594970703125,
        539.1612548828125
      ],
      "text": "uninterrupted treatment and intake of all medicines in the regimen; however, when medicine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        537.9183349609375,
        273.5291442871094,
        552.361328125
      ],
      "text": "cannot be tolerated it should be stopped;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.1182861328125,
        78.23609924316406,
        565.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        551.1182861328125,
        527.4013671875,
        565.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "consecutive treatment interruption (of all medicines in the regimen) of up to 2 weeks should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        564.3182983398438,
        299.1029968261719,
        578.7612915039062
      ],
      "text": "made up and added to the treatment duration;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.518310546875,
        78.23609924316406,
        591.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        577.518310546875,
        527.3905029296875,
        591.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "non-consecutive missed doses of all medicines in the regimen up to a cumulative total of 4 weeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        590.7183227539062,
        367.968505859375,
        605.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "should be made up and added to the treatment duration; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.9183349609375,
        78.23609924316406,
        618.361328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        603.9183349609375,
        527.4234008789062,
        618.361328125
      ],
      "text": "after consecutive administration of linezolid at recommended doses (600 mg/daily) for at least",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        617.1182861328125,
        527.5167846679688,
        631.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "9 weeks, in case of intolerability the dose can either be adjusted down (to linezolid 300 mg/daily) or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972314834594727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        630.3182983398438,
        527.392578125,
        644.7612915039062
      ],
      "text": "omitted (while other medicines in the regimen are continued) for a total of a maximum of 8 weeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        643.518310546875,
        239.23876953125,
        657.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "throughout the treatment course.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        665.22216796875,
        527.4410400390625,
        679.6651611328125
      ],
      "text": "In case any single one of these tolerances is exceeded, a thorough assessment of the patient’s status",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.4222412109375,
        449.4465637207031,
        692.865234375
      ],
      "text": "will be required to decide whether to continue the treatment strategy or modify it.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "72 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}